 "note": "Traced the paved group-camp road south of the highway: the entry lane from the highway past the parking to the turnaround circle, the circle, the lower lane east past the East Loop Group Camp area, the west lane toward the West Loop Group Camp and the short spur southwest to the paved lot. Left out the faint dirt tracks farther west and the lanes among the east sites near x 0..20, which are broken by trees. Read off 5 m grids at 8 px/m; the lower lane differed by about 4 m between two zooms, so I averaged it."
